/-!
# Genuine native six-cubes and actual maps from the literal unit six-sphere

The original cube boundary is collapsed by an actual continuous quotient
map onto the original Euclidean unit six-sphere. Every genuine based
six-loop factors uniquely through a continuous map on that sphere, with
the original base point and literal original cube map retained.

The factorization preserves the actual native sixth Hurewicz cycle and
homology class. It does not assume or assert that the target is recognized
as a sphere, is homotopy equivalent to a sphere, or is diffeomorphic to one.
-/
